==English==

===Etymology===
Borrowed from {{bor|en|de|Kanzler}}.

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun|Kanzlers}}

# {{surname|en|from=German}}.

====Statistics====
* According to the 2010 United States Census, ''Kanzler'' is the 33941<sup>st</sup> most common surname in the United States, belonging to 670 individuals. ''Kanzler'' is most common among White (96.27%) individuals.

